[[ChileFirst]] decided to support Piñera on 29 March 2009 after its leader, senator [[Fernando Flores]], declined to run for president.<ref name="nacionch1"/> It officially proclaimed him on 15 August 2009.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://pinera2010.cl/2009/08/15/chileprimero-proclamo-a-sebastian-pinera-como-su-candidato-presidencial/ |title=Piñera es el candidato de ChilePrimero &#124; Sebastián Piñera 2010 |publisher=Pinera2010.cl |date=2010-01-18 |access-date=2010-02-01 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120226184301/http://www.pinera2010.cl/2009/08/15/chileprimero-proclamo-a-sebastian-pinera-como-su-candidato-presidencial/ |archive-date=26 February 2012 }}</ref>

