*'''[[Fernando Flores]]''': The former minister of Salvador Allende and current senator launched a failed presidential bid for the 2005 election. He resigned from the PPD in early 2007 and launched a new party, ''[[ChileFirst]]''. On 29 March 2009 ChileFirst decided to support Piñera after Flores declined to run for president.<ref name="nacionch1">{{cite web |author=Diario La Nación Online |url=http://www.lanacion.cl/prontus_noticias_v2/site/artic/20090328/pags/20090328224642.html |title=Apoyo a Piñera profundiza división en Chile Primero |publisher=La Nacion.cl |access-date=2010-02-01 |archive-date=1 April 2009 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20090401124441/http://www.lanacion.cl/prontus_noticias_v2/site/artic/20090328/pags/20090328224642.html |url-status=dead }}</ref>
