|- valign="top"
| style="text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;"| [[File:Concertacion.svg|150px|center]]
| style="text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;"| [[File:Frei crop.jpg|150px|center]]'''[[Eduardo Frei Ruiz-Tagle]]'''<br /><small>([[Christian Democrat Party of Chile|PDC]])</small>
| The ''[[Concertación]]'' selected former president [[Eduardo Frei Ruiz-Tagle]] from the [[Christian Democrat Party of Chile|Christian Democrat Party]] as its single candidate for president. The selection process involved a single regional primary on 5 April 2009 in the [[Maule Region|Maule]] and [[O'Higgins Region|O'Higgins]] regions between Frei and [[José Antonio Gómez Urrutia]] from the [[Social Democrat Radical Party]]. Frei won with 65% versus 35% for Gómez. Had the percentage difference between both candidates been less than 20%, the selection process would have continued with additional primaries in other regions until 17 May.

Frei was legally proclaimed as presidential candidate by the PPD on 1 August 2009<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.cooperativa.cl/frei-ratifico-disposicion-a-intervenir-para-resolver-pugna-en-la-concertacion/prontus_nots/2009-08-01/175213.html# |title=Frei ratificó disposición a "intervenir" para resolver pugna en la Concertación |publisher=Cooperativa.cl |date=2009-08-01 |access-date=2010-02-01}}</ref> and by the PDC, PS and PRSD on 22 August 2009.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.cooperativa.cl/prontus_nots/site/artic/20090822/pags/20090822212626.html |title=Proclamación radical completó alineación de partidos de la Concertación tras Eduardo Frei |publisher=Cooperativa.cl |access-date=2010-02-01}}</ref> He submitted his candidacy to the Electoral Service on 12 September 2009.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://latercera.com/contenido/674_180967_9.shtml |title=Frei inscribe candidatura en el Servel acompañado de Angela Jeria &#124; POLÍTICA |publisher=latercera.com |access-date=2010-02-01 |archive-date=13 July 2011 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20110713190137/http://latercera.com/contenido/674_180967_9.shtml |url-status=dead }}</ref>
|}

